Absolutely, sir. I’ll keep this entirely client-side, dependency-free, and lightweight. The three files below are complete and ready to deploy to Vercel as a static site.

### `index.html`

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Community Resource Hub for local emergency resources, shelters, food, water, charging stations, and medical assistance.">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b172a">
  <title>Community Resource Hub</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>

<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header-content">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">LOCAL EMERGENCY SUPPORT</p>
          <h1>Community Resource Hub</h1>
          <p class="header-description">
            Find nearby shelters, food, water, charging stations, and medical resources during local emergencies.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="emergency-banner" role="region" aria-label="Emergency contact numbers">
          <div class="emergency-title">
            <span class="emergency-icon" aria-hidden="true">!</span>
            Emergency Contact Numbers
          </div>

          <div class="emergency-numbers">
            <a href="tel:911">
              <span>Emergency</span>
              <strong>911</strong>
            </a>

            <a href="tel:211">
              <span>Community Help</span>
              <strong>211</strong>
            </a>

            <a href="tel:311">
              <span>City Services</span>
              <strong>311</strong>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="search-section" aria-labelledby="search-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="search-wrapper">
          <label id="search-heading" for="searchInput" class="search-label">
            Find a resource
          </label>

          <div class="search-box">
            <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M21 21l-4.35-4.35m1.35-5.65a7 7 0 1 1-14 0 7 7 0 0 1 14 0z"/>
            </svg>

            <input
              id="searchInput"
              type="search"
              placeholder="Search by city, neighborhood, or resource..."
              autocomplete="off"
              aria-label="Search emergency resources"
            >

            <button id="clearSearch" class="clear-search" type="button" aria-label="Clear search">
              ×
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="filter-row" role="group" aria-label="Filter resources">
          <button class="filter-btn active" type="button" data-filter="All" aria-pressed="true">
            All
          </button>

          <button class="filter-btn" type="button" data-filter="Shelters" aria-pressed="false">
            Shelters
          </button>

          <button class="filter-btn" type="button" data-filter="Water/Food" aria-pressed="false">
            Water / Food
          </button>

          <button class="filter-btn" type="button" data-filter="Charging Stations" aria-pressed="false">
            Charging Stations
          </button>

          <button class="filter-btn" type="button" data-filter="Medical" aria-pressed="false">
            Medical
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="resources-section" aria-labelledby="resources-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">AVAILABLE RESOURCES</p>
            <h2 id="resources-heading">Local Support</h2>
          </div>

          <p id="resultCount" class="result-count" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </div>

        <div id="resourceGrid" class="resource-grid"></div>

        <div id="emptyState" class="empty-state" hidden>
          <div class="empty-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌕</div>
          <h3>No resources found</h3>
          <p>
            Try another city, neighborhood, or resource category.
          </p>
          <button id="resetFilters" type="button" class="reset-btn">
            Reset filters
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container footer-content">
      <p>
        Community Resource Hub
      </p>
      <p>
        Information shown is for demonstration purposes. In an actual emergency, call 911.
      </p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="app.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
```

